RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES
--------------------
Excalidraw — @excalidraw/excalidraw 0.18.1 — MIT
  https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw
  The canvas text faces (Excalifont/Virgil hand-drawn styles and the UI
  fallback families: Assistant, Cascadia, Comic Shanns, Liberation, Lilita,
  Nunito, Xiaolai) are copied unmodified from the npm package into
  public/fonts at build time (scripts/copy-fonts.mjs; not committed) and
  served from this project's own origin, so a deployed build DOES
  redistribute them. Review each family's licence before publishing a
  build: per Excalidraw, the hand-drawn faces are CC BY 4.0 and most UI
  families are SIL OFL 1.1. The npm package ships no licence files next
