ON-DEVICE MODEL WEIGHTS (fetched on demand, not part of dist/)
--------------------------------------------------------------
Gemma 3 270M IT (Q4_K_M quantisation), converted to GGUF and published by
lm-kit: https://huggingface.co/lm-kit/gemma-3-270m-instruct-gguf
  © Google LLC. Distributed under the Gemma Terms of Use
  (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms), which permit redistribution of the
  weights with attribution — hence this notice. The 253 MB file is split
  into six ~42 MB parts committed under models/ and fetched at runtime
  from this origin's /models/ when present, else raw.githubusercontent.com; scripts/prepare-model.mjs records every
  part's size and SHA-256 in models/manifest.json and the app refuses any
  part that does not match.

